[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6399588023","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3616#issuecomment-6399588023","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3616","id":6399588023,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABfXH2tw","user":{"login":"yinwu01","id":71250493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUwNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71250493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01","html_url":"https://github.com/yinwu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-25T15:34:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T15:34:27Z","body":"I'll take this one. Padding covers the lines that get shorter, but some get longer: the message carries Codex's 399-byte summary prefix, so for a summary under about 1.3 KB it comes out longer than `magpie1:` plus the base64, and there's nothing to pad. My plan is to leave a rollout like that unported (it still works through magpie, just not without it), so a port never changes where a line starts.\n\nI'll also look at the rollouts a pass has already shortened. Their old length can be worked out from the summary, so they might be padded back, but only after checking that against the offsets Codex recorded. I'll post a branch here.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6399588023/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6451967218","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3616#issuecomment-6451967218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3616","id":6451967218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABgJE08g","user":{"login":"yinwu01","id":71250493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUwNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71250493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01","html_url":"https://github.com/yinwu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:08Z","body":"67b12956 fixes this on main: every line the port rewrites keeps its length (padded with spaces after its JSON, as you suggested), a longer one is left as it is in a paginated rollout, and a fork or a revert that already names a byte past its parent's end gets it set again from the parent's line ordinals, once per Codex home (repairLineages). That replaces my patch, so I'm not posting it.\n\nOne correction to what I said when I took this: an already ported line's old length can be worked out from the line itself (re-encoding changed key order, not length), but repairLineages doesn't need it.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6451967218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6620969126","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3616#issuecomment-6620969126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3616","id":6620969126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABiqP4pg","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-04T02:33:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:33:27Z","body":"take","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6620969126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]